@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Obligation/capability constraints through the shared SCC engine
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Source-ordered events\nwithin each process" as EVENTS #DBE4FF
component "recv on c before send on d" as ORDER #FFF3BF
component "Constraint\ncap(c) < obl(d)" as RULE #FFE8CC
component "Channel projection\nc -> d" as GRAPH #C3FAE8
component "Shared iterative\nprojection_sccs" as SCC #E5DBFF
component "Acyclic\ncanonical longest-path ranks" as RANK #D3F9D8
component "Cyclic\nNone levels + precise witnesses" as CYCLE #FCC2D7
component "Qualified report\ncomplete + issues" as REPORT #F1F3F5

EVENTS --> ORDER : exact channel origins
ORDER --> RULE
RULE --> GRAPH
GRAPH --> SCC
SCC --> RANK : condensation is acyclic
SCC --> CYCLE : cyclic component
RANK --> REPORT
CYCLE --> REPORT

note right of RULE #FFF9DB
Matching co-actions share one canonical rank.
A cycle implies k < k by transitivity.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF> | normalized event input |
|<#FFF3BF> | ordered behavioral evidence |
|<#FFE8CC> | type-level inequality |
|<#C3FAE8> | channel graph projection |
|<#E5DBFF> | reused SCC infrastructure |
|<#D3F9D8> | finite modeled levels |
|<#FCC2D7> | cyclic advisory evidence |
|<#F1F3F5> | completeness boundary |
endlegend
@enduml
